{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_02_beg","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_02","title":"双重保险","storyCode":"CV-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cc044789ce92b66c885963c2183b77869c76ff499124b66c1681051891254fbd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"黑钢小队终于在餐厅内齐聚，交换信息后，迅速分配好任务。过程中，当地居民里昂主动提出要加入小队的动力炉修缮工作。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，杰西卡，你去干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我得去找他——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......芙兰卡？罗拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么在这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，已经确定杰西卡的位置，她就在那家餐厅，嘴角还油汪汪的，看起来她已经对餐厅的菜单颇有心得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，银行这边的事情也差不多告一段落了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"优等生，我们等你等得快要饿死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家餐厅的位置有些偏僻，我找到这里花了不少时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，凑合凑合算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你们把迈尔斯安全送回家，我心里是很感激没错，但你们要是对我的厨艺发表意见，可就是另外一码事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会？天寒地冻的时候有口热饭吃，我们有什么可挑剔的。你说对吧，小罗拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——对，我觉得很好吃！我妈妈和我奶奶都没有你做的好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是有懂行的嘛！小朋友，她们是做什么的？厨师吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我妈妈是医生，奶奶是工程师，她们都不会做饭......我爸爸才是家里做饭的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗、噗哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，你是不是开心过头了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，别别别，我吃饭，我这就吃饭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......老板娘，请问这里有水吗？我想来一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随手拿起桌上的空杯子，老板娘推开窗户，从厚厚的积雪中铲了满满一整杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等着吧，化开就能喝了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，为什么是银行的人来和我们对接，队长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的政府机构只是勉强运转，没有余力与我们对接，所以将此事全权交付给了银行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"银行？！那好吧，银行是怎么说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"银行的话可以大致总结为两句：总而言之，全力支持；具体问题，容后再议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，一听就很难缠，但你该不会就这么灰溜溜地跑来吃饭了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们既无资源，也无人手，但好歹手里有钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们本来也不缺经费。不过......如果银行说到做到的话，我们在达维镇上多雇点工人怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动力炉出事后，地块上多数人都选择了离开，现在不好说还有几名工人留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得，已经快八点了，可居民楼里没几扇窗户亮着灯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实不用那么多人，修理工作交给我和小队成员就可以。我们真正需要的是熟知能源塔内情况的人。银行有提供合适人选吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚光顾着修你的通讯器，忘记自我介绍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂·特雷门，本地矿厂的爆破工程师，很高兴认识你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿厂的爆破工程师......一直留到现在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，还是有那么几个固执的老家伙不愿意离开的。我四岁时就在这片矿厂了，去别的地方我根本适应不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年初动力炉出问题就是我带着人去处理的。最后虽然没能修好，但好歹让它继续运转了一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您做得很好，它直到现在还在运转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是过去的事了，不提也罢，但你们刚刚说的酬劳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个......任务要求是尽快，所以不按日结算，每天只发必要的经费和食宿费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到动力炉修好之后，报酬一次性结清，越快修好，额度越高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，出于合作考虑，我们可以预付一部分报酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体数字是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的工作应该是顾问。顾问的话，两个月搞定的报酬是四万，一个月内搞定就翻番，要是一周内能搞定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再翻一倍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多一些，你能拿到二十万。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成交！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，你答应得这么痛快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十万，那可是好大一笔钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里，钱再多也没地方花吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是年轻人啊。二十万，让年轻人吃喝玩乐绰绰有余，但要是让中年人还债务，那就是杯水车薪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......债务？您欠债了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是我，地块上的所有人都欠债了。唉......话都说到这份上了，我就直说了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一来就问的，那个往雪地里去的男人，多半就是因为债务......之前这样的事情不少，欠了债后破产，走投无路就只好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都不带，径直往雪原上走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那还有活路吗，我当时应该拦住他的。里昂先生，现在去找的话，还能救吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，别想了，你救不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杰西卡，这不是你的错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，罗拉，你和里昂先生还有什么要谈的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......对，大叔，明天还来这里找我们，要是有资料也可以一同带过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，没问题，我还认识一些矿工，他们也是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不用，有你就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别呀，多招几个呗。理解一下，毕竟地块上能走的年轻人都走了，留下来的都是些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我一样的老家伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，多谢你来看我，我真没事。你该回家了，再晚下去，里昂该着急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我习题还没写完呢......再说，我也不想回家。我爸他......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂脾气是急了点，但这么多年了，他对你的感情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯，我都懂，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......还暖和吗？需不需要往火盆里再添点柴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，挺暖和的......迈尔斯，今天送你回家的那些人就是救了你的黑钢小队吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，她们来帮我们修能源塔。等能源塔修好了，供热完全恢复，我们就不用烧火盆取暖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算能源塔能修好......也不代表地块自此就能好起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......像你这样整天操心这么多事，当心掉头发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我爸从来不操心这些事，我不替他想，还有谁来想呢？原来还有卡尔，现在卡尔又不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯！迈尔斯你在吗？感谢我给咱俩找了好活计！既能修好动力炉，又能得一大笔钱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸？你怎么过来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，你在这里啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先在这儿自习吧，我和迈尔斯一起去见那些黑钢的姑娘们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就见过了，就是她们救了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我这记性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人找过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我找了一大圈......那些人要么走了，要么准备搬走，要么躺平认栽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿意在动力炉里折腾的，也只有你和我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全屋预计要到明天晚上才能正式投入使用，紧急集合点暂时先设在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，明天工程小队全权交由你指挥，务必在最短时间内恢复地块的移动能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于芙兰卡和杰西卡，我这里有些杂七杂八的活要给你们。一个人得和我再去跑一趟银行。另一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要去地块外围和无人区域确认安全情况，银行员工说偶尔地块上会有外面的流匪进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我可以选择去地块外围吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，那我就陪你走一趟银行，去见识见识那些让我们雷蛇队长头疼的家伙到底是什么样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位请注意，塔内大部分区域活性源石粉尘经过长时间沉降后，基本安全，但仍有小部分区域指数超标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体的危险区位置已经同步给各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一次热抢修，尽管功率很低，能源塔仍处于工作状态。所以，活动时请注意防护，如有意外发生及时报告。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你们二位了，要不然我们还得花时间逐个排查危险区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里工作了大半辈子，比起通道里面的破屋子，我更愿意把这里称为“家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我可要在你家里大动手脚了，迈尔斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请便请便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......损坏成这样，它居然还在燃烧？简直是个奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前迈尔斯与我加强了炉膛，一方面防备事故，另一方面能让锅炉烧源石燃料之外的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，今年入冬之后，刚开始还有废弃的源石制品，后来有木头烧都算好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在......也只能先看看情况了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A组已就位，其他小队报告位置与情况，一分钟后开始故障排查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"B组已就位，联合循环装置损坏程度目测约有百分之三十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"C组已就位，冷却系统彻底损毁，但我们可以借助冬季的低温空气临时重做一个风冷系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"D组已就位，排灰风道目前运作良好，根据各组需要我们会及时调整速率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，请各位做好准备——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开工。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我已经到最后一个巡查地点了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这一路上有流匪的踪迹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没......我一路开车过来什么也没发现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":true,"text":"杰西卡，我和芙兰卡要接着对付银行了，你自己多加小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":true,"text":"一旦发生问题，不必考虑我们这边是否方便，立刻联系。明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜女士说伍德洛先生打猎回来会从这附近经过......也不知道能不能碰到他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是松油的味道......这里怎么会有这种气味？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"松枝......有人在这里生过火？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人从那里经过......谁？是伍、伍德洛先生，他从地块外回来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......伍、伍德洛先生，等等，等下我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后面那人是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！妈的，又是来坏事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生，这附近可能会有流窜的匪徒，您应该赶紧返回地块上的安全区域......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，您看起来怎么那么生气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你实在是很能给人添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可刚刚那个人在你背后放冷箭，我是为了救你啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我费了一番功夫才引出那家伙，现在所有线索都被你那颗子弹打碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么会......抱歉，我......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您在调查什么事？或许我能帮上忙弥补一下什么的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然意识到这里有流窜的匪徒，那你有想过他们来这里的目的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无非是生活艰难......劫掠物资？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地块上的东西连喂饱我们都费劲，他们能看得上？他们平时做的是杀掠商队，抢劫货物的生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那他们是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近地块上有很多人不见了，失踪前有居民曾看到他们与这里的一群混混往来密切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想问的是，你来这里干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......按照被分配到的任务，维护地块边缘无人区的安全，保证流窜在地块外的匪徒不会影响动力炉的修理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就你一个人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......还有几个队友。况且，伍德洛先生您不是也在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回见吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！子弹的事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，走远了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
